# Build context for the `frontend` service (context: ./frontend).
#
# node_modules is the load-bearing entry: the Dockerfile runs `npm ci` and then
# `COPY . .`, so without this the host's node_modules is copied straight over
# the tree npm ci just installed — the image then ships whatever was on a
# developer's laptop rather than what package-lock.json pins.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*
!.env.development

.DS_Store
.git
.vscode
coverage
playwright-report
test-results
stats.html
*.log
